From c3c24533dff41f8190540051fb0587511dc14aa1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:52:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Tamer looks: a new game asks boy or girl and opens the
 Look page

After the name, before the first screen, a panel asks whether the tamer is a boy or a girl with the tamer shown as chosen, and then opens the Look page with Start and Back in place of Save and Exit. Start goes on with the opening; Back returns to the question.
---
 src/main/game_menu.c   | 141 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/main/main.c        |   2 +
 src/main/mod_species.c |  10 +++
 text/main/mod_lab.yaml |   9 +++
 4 files changed, 159 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

